# The /dev of WEGA 3.1, as the installation makes it: the /dev section of the file CONTENTS of the installation
# floppy root1 (tmp/wega31_disks/w31root1.raw), copied unchanged. A line: TYPE (b block, c character) and MODE,
# OWNER, GROUP, MAJOR, MINOR, NAME; "l NAME": another name (a link) of the entry before it.
# z8k-emu reads it as the guest's /dev (Z8K_DEVTAB, host/z8k-emu/README.md); the models of the devices come from the
# case (corpus field device:, terminal:).
